{"unit_id": "tag:01S2:title", "translation": "根性（Radicial）和普遍单射（injective）态射（morphisms）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Radicial", "target_term": "根性"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Radicial", "target_term": "根性", "context": "标题中的第一种态射性质"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "标题中的普遍单射性"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "标题讨论的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01S2:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节定义概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）何谓<TEXTITOPEN_0001>根性（radicial）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，以及概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）何谓<TEXTITOPEN_0002>普遍单射（universally injective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。然后我们证明这两个概念一致。之所以引入这两个概念，是因为在代数空间（algebraic spaces）的情形下，有与之对应的概念，而它们未必总是一致。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "radicial", "target_term": "根性"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally injective", "target_term": "普遍单射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一种性质所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义根性的对象"}, {"source_term": "radicial", "target_term": "根性", "context": "本节引入的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二种性质所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义普遍单射性的对象"}, {"source_term": "universally injective", "target_term": "普遍单射", "context": "本节引入的第二种性质"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "具有相应概念的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01S3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 我们称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>普遍单射（universally injective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，当且仅当对任意概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>（在底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）上）是单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 如果<MATH_0005>满足以下条件，我们称它为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>根性（radicial）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>：<MATH_0006>作为拓扑空间（topological spaces）的映射（map）是单射（injective），且对每个<MATH_0007>，域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0008>都是纯不可分（purely inseparable）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally injective", "target_term": "普遍单射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "radicial", "target_term": "根性"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "purely inseparable", "target_term": "纯不可分"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所定义的性质的适用对象"}, {"source_term": "universally injective", "target_term": "普遍单射", "context": "第一项所定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "用于基变换的态射所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用于基变换的任意态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "第一项中接受单射性检验的构造"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "单射性所针对的底层对象"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "基变换的底层映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "radicial", "target_term": "根性", "context": "第二项所定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "第二项中映射所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第二项中接受单射性检验的映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "根性的第一个条件"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "根性的第二个条件中的扩张对象"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "根性的第二个条件中比较两域的关系"}, {"source_term": "purely inseparable", "target_term": "纯不可分", "context": "根性的第二个条件要求的扩张性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01S4:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对每个域（field）<MATH_0002>，诱导映射（induced map）<MATH_0003>是单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是普遍单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是根性（radicial）的。\n<STRUCT_0005> 对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是满射（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "radicial", "target_term": "根性"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中态射所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所列条件之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第一项量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射", "context": "第一项所检验的映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "第一项规定的映射性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二项所指的原态射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "第二项中的普遍单射性"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项所指的原态射"}, {"source_term": "radicial", "target_term": "根性", "context": "第三项规定的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "限定第四项所指的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term":