{"unit_id": "tag:05VE:proof", "translation": "将引理<REF_0001>与如下事实结合起来：<MATH_0001>是分离（separated）的，当且仅当<MATH_0002>的像（image）在<MATH_0003>中是闭（closed）的。见概形（Schemes）篇定义<REF_0002>及其后的讨论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "所引用判别条件的左侧性质"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "判别分离性所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "用以判别分离性的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义出处的篇名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0472:statement", "translation": "普遍单射（injective）的态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）仍是普遍单射（injective）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "基变换前的普遍单射性"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "接受基变换的对象"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "施加于态射的构造"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "基变换后仍成立的普遍单射性"}], "notes": []}
