{"unit_id": "tag:01S7:statement", "translation": "仿射（affine）态射（morphism）是分离（separated）且拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "引理的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "引理结论的第一种性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "引理结论的第二种性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01S7:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是仿射（affine）的。拟紧性（Quasi-compactness）可由概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0001>立即得出。\n下面证明<MATH_0002>是分离（separated）的，所用的是概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>中的点（points），它们映射（map）到同一点（point）<MATH_0005>。任取一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>，使它包含<MATH_0007>。由假设，<MATH_0008>是仿射（affine）的。将所引用的引理用于<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "Quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "证明开头所用的假设"}, {"source_term": "Quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性", "context": "由第一个引用立即得出的结论"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一个引理引用的篇名"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "第二个引用用于证明的结论"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二个引理引用的篇名"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "映向同一目标点的各点"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "各点到共同目标的对应"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "各点的共同像点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "包含给定点的开集"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "由假设得出的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01S8:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是仿射（affine）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在一个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，使得每个<MATH_0004>都是仿射（affine）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在一个由<MATH_0005>-代数（algebras）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0006>，以及一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0007>（作为<MATH_0008>上的概形（schemes））。记号见构造（Constructions）篇第<REF_0001>节。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n而且在这种情形下，<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中态射所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "三个条件所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "三项条件之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项所考察的原态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第一项所要求的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二项中组成覆盖的开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第二项要求存在的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第二项中每个对象应具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第三项中层的代数结构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "第三项要