{"unit_id": "tag:01S8:proof", "translation": "显然，(1) 蕴含 (2)。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering），使得每个<MATH_0002>都是仿射（affine）的。由概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0001>可知，<MATH_0003>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。由概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0002>可知，态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。因此，由概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0003>可知，层（sheaf）<MATH_0005>是由<MATH_0006>-代数（algebras）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。于是得到概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>（在<MATH_0008>上）。\n恒等映射（identity map）<MATH_0009>经由相对谱（relative spectrum）的定义给出一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>（在<MATH_0011>上），见构造（Constructions）篇引理<REF_0004>。\n由假设和刚引用的引理可知，限制（restriction）<MATH_0012>是同构（isomorphism）。因此<MATH_0013>是同构（isomorphism）。这就证明了 (2) 蕴含 (3)。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n假设 (3) 成立。由构造（Constructions）篇引理<REF_0005>可知，每个仿射开集（affine open）的逆（inverse）像（image）都是仿射（affine）的，因而按定义，该态射（morphism）是仿射（affine）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {