{"unit_id": "tag:01S9:statement", "translation": "我们也可以如下直接证明上面的引理<REF_0001>中 (2) 蕴含 (1)。\n设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering），使得每个<MATH_0002>都是仿射（affine）的。先如上面的证明那样，证明<MATH_0003>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的。\n设<MATH_0004>为仿射开集（affine open）。我们须证明<MATH_0005>是仿射（affine）的。置<MATH_0006>。\n由概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0002>可知，存在一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0007>（在<MATH_0008>上）。\n由概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0003>可知，存在一个整数（integer）<MATH_0009>、一个标准开集（standard open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0010>，<MATH_0011>，以及一个映射（map）<MATH_0012>，使得每个<MATH_0013>也是仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0014>的标准开集（standard open）。在仿射概形（affine schemes）的态射（morphism）下，标准开集（standard open）的逆（inverse）像（image）仍是标准开集（standard open），见代数（Algebra）篇引理<REF_0004>。因此<MATH_0015>是<MATH_0016>的标准开集（standard open），特别地，<MATH_0017>是仿射（affine）的。由于<MATH_0018>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，有<MATH_0019>，故<MATH_0020>是<MATH_0021>的谱（spectrum）。\n于是，态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>诱导开集（open）<MATH_0023>与开集（open）<MATH_0024>之间的同构（isomorphism），其中后者是<MATH_0025>中的开集。由于<MATH_0026>且<MATH_0027>，所求即得。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"